"680\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QueenOfShiba3.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QueenOfShiba3.jpg?resize=320%2C320&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QueenOfShiba3.jpg?resize=600%2C600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QueenOfShiba3.jpg?resize=240%2C240&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/QueenOfShiba3.jpg?resize=768%2C768&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a><figcaption>Words from a page in <em>The Daughter of the Queen of Sheba</em> by Jacki Lyden over micrograph of maple leaf. Available as <a href=\"https://www.redbubble.com/i/acrylic-block/Little-Free-Library-Divination-25-by-mariapopova/176281219.P5BX3\" target=\"_blank\">an acrylic block</a>.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.redbubble.com/i/acrylic-block/Little-Free-Library-Divination-21-by-mariapopova/176281174.P5BX3\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ItEndsWithUs_woodpecker.jpg?resize=680%2C680&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"680\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ItEndsWithUs_woodpecker.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ItEndsWithUs_woodpecker.jpg?resize=320%2C320&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ItEndsWithUs_woodpecker.jpg?resize=600%2C600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ItEndsWithUs_woodpecker.jpg?resize=240%2C240&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/ItEndsWithUs_woodpecker.jpg?resize=768%2C768&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a><figcaption>Words from a page in <em>It Ends with Us</em> by Colleen Hoover over micrograph of