an.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/beeseason1.jpg?resize=600%2C600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/beeseason1.jpg?resize=240%2C240&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/beeseason1.jpg?resize=768%2C768&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a><figcaption>Words from a page in <em>Bee Season</em> by Myla Goldberg over micrograph of lichen. Available as <a href=\"https://www.redbubble.com/i/acrylic-block/Little-Free-Library-Divination-26-by-mariapopova/176281227.P5BX3\" target=\"_blank\">an acrylic block</a>.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.redbubble.com/i/acrylic-block/Little-Free-Library-Divination-31-by-mariapopova/176281319.P5BX3\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/bible_fig.jpg?resize=680%2C680&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"680\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/bible_fig.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/bible_fig.jpg?resize=320%2C320&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/bible_fig.jpg?resize=600%2C600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/bible_fig.jpg?resize=240%2C240&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/bible_fig.jpg?resize=768%2C768&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></a><figcaption>Words from a page in the Bible over micrograph of the season’s last fig from the neighborhood tree. Available as <a href=\"https://www.redbubble.com/i/acrylic-block/Little-Free-Library-Divination-31-by-mariapopova/176281319.P5BX3\" target=\"_blank\">an acrylic block</a>.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.redbubble.com/i/acrylic-block/Little-Free-Library-Divination-27-by-mariapopova/176281245.P5BX3\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.w